  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Pin the Nix flake to 1.18.1 with its real release hashes by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1391\n* Resume a paused machine that was itself restored from a checkpoint by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1390\n* Start a machine whose previous VM left a failed systemd scope behind by @LoganGrasby in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1396\n* Read and write files inside a forked machine's container overlay by @LoganGrasby in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1395\n* Stop a fork pool from failing every boot on a stale retained checkpoint by @LoganGrasby in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1394\n* Restore a network-less machine from a live checkpoint by @LoganGrasby in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1393\n* Prepare SmolVM v1.18.2 for release by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1397\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/compare/v1.18.1...v1.18.2",
